return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.2.3','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:43+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:43+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'在你按下「啟用 Babilim」時傳送，若網站必須重新註冊也會再次傳送：你網站的 URL、WordPress、PHP 與 Babilim 版本、網站語言與網站上使用的語言，以及為此網站產生的公開金鑰。','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'每次檢查時傳送：已安裝外掛與佈景主題的清單，以及為它們安裝的任何 Babilim 翻譯的狀態、使用中的語言，和簡短的診斷代碼。','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'每個請求都會包含你網站的 URL，並在服務需要時附上網站的存取權杖。','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Babilim 傳送給服務的內容','Your site\'s URL'=>'你網站的 URL','WordPress version'=>'WordPress 版本','PHP version'=>'PHP 版本','Babilim version'=>'Babilim 版本','Your site\'s language'=>'你網站的語言','Languages in use on your site'=>'你網站使用中的語言','A public key for this site'=>'這個網站的公開金鑰','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'為這個網站產生的公開金鑰，用於證明請求確實來自這個網站。只會傳送公開的一半；私密的一半會留在你的網站上。','Installed plugins and themes'=>'已安裝的外掛與佈景主題','Source files (only if you confirm an upload)'=>'原始碼檔案（僅在你確認上傳時）','Diagnostic codes'=>'診斷代碼','Up to 20 short diagnostic codes (for example, a translation file that failed its check), each with the plugin or theme, the language and the time it happened. They never contain any text from your site or any translated text.'=>'最多 20 個簡短的診斷代碼（例如翻譯檔案未通過檢查），每個都附有外掛或佈景主題、語言與發生時間。這些代碼絕不包含你網站上的任何文字或任何翻譯文字。','%1$d site on this network is set to